<title>USA: Airborne Express invests in Aramex.</title>
<headline>Airborne Express invests in Aramex.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airborne Freight Corp said it made a $2.0 million investment in the common stock of Aramex International Ltd, giving Airborne 8.9 percent ownership of the Middle East express delivery and freight forwarding company.</p>
<p>Aramex provides services from its main hubs in Dubai, London, New York, and Amman primarily to, and from and within destinations in the Middle East and the Indian Sub-Continent.</p>
</text>
